# Figma export
#
# The Figma Capture / All buttons in the Layers panel render the page's Figma
# frames through the Figma REST API, at a scale that follows the viewport width
# (2x on mobile, down to 1x on desktop). Leave FIGMA_TOKEN unset and each user
# is asked for their own token, kept in their browser and sent with each export.
# Generate one in Figma: Settings > Security > Personal access tokens, with the
# "File content: Read-only" scope. Rendering images is a Tier 1 endpoint: a
# View or Collab seat gets very few calls, so use a Dev or Full seat.
FIGMA_TOKEN=
